  stableId: order.simple.c12
  difficulty: 0
  orderBubbles:
  - My husband pulled every muscle fighting a broken oven door,
  - then scraped his arm on a filthy hinge.
  - Now the pain is severe
  - and heat is spreading from the cut.
  - His lungs are strong, he has no asthma,
  - and he is sweating rather than cold.
  - Joan's notes recommend Salix alba for the pain
  - and Borago officinalis when infection may enter the blood.
  - Brew both. The oven has already won enough.
  firstHerbId: herb.whiteWillow
  secondHerbId: herb.borage
